  "name": "flame_wisp_crimson",
  "description": "dense flame swirls and strands, cobalt blue on one side turning through violet to crimson round a red glow on the other",
  "reference": {
    "image": "deaths-icy-hand-25.jpg",
    "folder": "fractal-drive-sync/style-refs",
